Cell["\<\
A shortest path is a segment, and a member of the segment between its ends, \
but not a member of the line through them: it can be prolonged:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"196717f9-3fe2-47e7-aaa7-5d5be31e380d"],

